# The site's onion, run by the web server compose's tor (docs/two-machines.md).
# One onion service. Keys in /var/lib/tor (on the host /var/lib/ccs-tor, owned by the tor user).
# Port 80 goes to Caddy's socket (www).
# Single-hop: the site is public and its address known, so hiding the server gains nothing,
# and three fewer hops make it faster. No SOCKS port (a single-hop service may not have one),
# and no relaying (built without it).
SocksPort 0
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor/data
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/ccs
HiddenServicePort 80 unix:/run/ccs-www/onion.sock
HiddenServiceNonAnonymousMode 1
HiddenServiceSingleHopMode 1
Log notice stdout
